              "instruction": "zhè shì wǒ de shǒujī — This is my phone.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *zhè shì wǒ de shǒujī* — This is my phone.]"
            },
            {
